New: CartGridPointwiseFunction and make_cart_grid_pointwise_function provide
functor-based initialization and transformation of scalar, vector, and tensor
values on cell-, node-, side-, face-, and edge-centered patch data. The factory
selects the centering from a SAMRAI variable at construction. CartesianCentering
provides the SAMRAI types and geometry for each DataCentering and models the
Centering concept. The same dispatch is used by CartGridFunctionSet.
<br>
(Aaron Barrett and Boyce Griffith, 2026/09/10)
